        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yhA3cgS0JJzfBXR5sFbrAJ-A2KU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/82768-lauras-quick-slow-cooker-turkey-chili-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-9905915d01b444ddb033fa6158e168dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/82768/step_04.webp"
